          "formula": "//IF [Top n] THEN [Manufacturer] ELSE 'Other' END\r\nIF [Region] = 'Central' AND [Top Central] THEN [Calculation_352125225145667584]\r\nELSEIF [Region] = 'East' AND [Top Central (copy)] THEN [Calculation_352125225145667584]\r\nELSEIF [Region] = 'South' AND [Top Central (copy 2)] THEN [Calculation_352125225145667584]\r\nELSEIF  [Region] = 'West' AND [Top East (copy)] THEN [Calculation_352125225145667584]\r\nELSE 'Other'\r\nEND",
